<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Airport Departure Board</title>
</head>

<body>

<header>

    <h1>✈️ CITY AIRPORT</h1>

    <p>
        DEPARTURES
    </p>

</header>

<hr>

<main>

<table border="1" cellpadding="12">

    <tr>
        <th>Flight</th>
        <th>Destination</th>
        <th>Time</th>
        <th>Gate</th>
        <th>Status</th>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>AX102</td>
        <td>Mumbai</td>
        <td>08:30</td>
        <td>A2</td>
        <td>On Time</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>BT215</td>
        <td>Delhi</td>
        <td>10:15</td>
        <td>B4</td>
        <td>Boarding</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>CM304</td>
        <td>Bengaluru</td>
        <td>12:45</td>
        <td>C1</td>
        <td>Scheduled</td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td>DX410</td>
        <td>Hyderabad</td>
        <td>03:30</td>
        <td>A5</td>
        <td>Delayed</td>
    </tr>

</table>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>📢 Airport Announcement</h2>

    <p>
        Passengers should check their boarding gate
        and flight status before proceeding to the gate.
    </p>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🛫 Terminal Information</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Terminal 1 — Domestic Flights</li>
        <li>Terminal 2 — International Flights</li>
        <li>Information Desk — Main Lobby</li>
    </ul>

</section>

</main>

<footer>
    <hr>
    <p>City Airport — Sample HTML Project</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
